gered [by my own comment](https://lobste.rs/c/dv0zqn), I thought this might be a good starting point for a discussion about how to secure platforms not only technically, but also socially and financially.\r\n\r\nMods: this is my first submission, feel free to tell me how to improve. I had a hard time choosing a tag, but I think this may be relevant to the community.","submitter_user":"kolja","user_is_author":false,"tags":["finance","privacy"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/wxnibb","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/wxnibb/i_shuts_down"},{"short_id":"rok1za","created_at":"2026-09-17T10:06:08.154-05:00","title":"Everybody's Lost Their Minds","url":"https://www.netmeister.org/blog/everybodys-lost-their-minds.html","score":17,"flags":0,"comment_count":2,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"j11g","user_is_author":false,"tags":["culture"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/rok1za","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/rok1za/everybody_s_lost_their_minds"},{"short_id":"cianny","created_at":"2026-09-16T10:04:45.848-05:00","title":"Why i'm still bearish on LLMs after Navier-Stokes","url":"https://dank.systems/posts/2026-09-15-ai-bear.html","score":47,"flags":2,"comment_count":13,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"andyc","user_is_author":false,"tags":["vibecoding"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/cianny","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/cianny/why_i_m_still_bearish_on_llms_after_navier"},{"short_id":"lox1su","created_at":"2026-09-16T17:55:11.955-05:00","title":"Why .tar.gz files can't be combined with cat","url":"https://alexwlchan.net/2026/cat-confusion/","score":20,"flags":0,"comment_count":15,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"gavinmorrow","user_is_author":false,"tags":["programming"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/lox1su","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/lox1su/why_tar_gz_files_can_t_be_combined_with_cat"},{"short_id":"zeeat3","created_at":"2026-09-17T01:00:53.253-05:00","title":"XApp —